    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate drifting thrill in this action-packed racing game! Conquer challenging tracks, from winding mountain roads to vibrant racing circuits, and perfect your driving skills. Choose from a wide variety of customizable cars, each with unique handling, and drift your way to the top of the public leaderboards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're racing solo or  competing AI rivals, the gripping blend of speed, style, and precision will keep you hooked. Show the world what it takes to be a drift master!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate drifting thrill in this action-packed racing game! Conquer challenging tracks, from winding mountain roads to vibrant racing circuits, and perfect your driving skills. Choose from a wide variety of customizable cars, each with unique handling, and drift your way to the top of the public leaderboards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're racing solo or  competing AI rivals, the gripping blend of speed, style, and precision will keep you hooked. Show the world what it takes to be a drift master!</p>",
